- 1. 1.hang_prot — hang_prot
- 2. 2.parity — parity/edc
- 3. 3.ia_bus_timeout — ia_bus_timeo
- 4. 5.cmm — cmm
- 5. 5.esm — esm
- 6. 6.apb2mbus — apb2mbus
- 7. 8.reset_checker — reset_checker
- 8. 9.int_prot — int_prot
- 9. 10.dup_ctrl — dup_ctrl
- 10. common_modules — 公共基础单元
